OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fdry and bright weather around this
OL,7,Fevening, but an isolated shower cannot
OL,8,Fbe ruled out. Turning rather chilly
OL,9,Fovernight with a few mist and fog
OL,10,Fpatches possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry start to Sunday with
OL,13,Fsome patchy cloud around. Heavy and
OL,14,Fpersistent rain will arrive later with
OL,15,Fstrengthening winds. Mild but feeling
OL,16,Fcooler in the rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
